"hadiths[2]{hadithnumber,text}:"
2900,"###
 Narrated to us by Abdur-Rahman bin Bishr bin Al-Hakam: He said, ""Yahya narrated to us from Ibn Jurayj."" And also narrated to us by Muhammad bin Ma'mar Al-Qaysi: He said, ""Muhammad bin Bakr informed us, and he said, 'Ibn Jurayj informed me, and he said, ""Abu Az-Zubayr informed me that he heard Jabir (RA) saying: 'We participated with the Messenger of Allah (ﷺ"
2901,"Narrated to us Yunus ibn 'Abd al-A'la, who said: Ibn Wahb informed us, who said: 'Amr ibn al-Harith and Malik ibn Anas informed me, on the authority of Abu az-Zubayr, on the authority of Jabir ibn 'Abdullah (RA), who said:
""We sacrificed with the Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) in the year of al-Hudaybiyah: a camel on behalf of seven people, and a cow on behalf of seven people.""

**CHAPTER:**"
